'''Seymour''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Fashion Shop}}. They sell 3 tuxedos: the {{Item|Cheap Tuxedo}}, {{Item|Fancy Tuxedo}}, and {{Item|Elegant Tuxedo}} for {{c|3m}}, {{c|20m}} and {{c|74,999,999}} respectively.

